        "title": "Papmei guai ta njian khou rui",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Papmei guai ta njian khou @&4,",
            "Raguang @&4 kanah tilou the;",
            "Kata lummei ringsuangmei latou the,",
            "Raguang ta thuan kuni halleluijah.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Halleluijah, he halleluijah (2),",
            "Guang bampang ding huamma (2);",
            "(2x)",
            "Ringpouh ta thuan bam ni.",
            "",
            "2. Ntau thu ai mei than dithe,",
            "Pou Jisu ta lalou nung @&4;",
            "Neila daimei rapture guangpui nung kiu,",
            "Ai sam tat puni e halleluijah.",
            "",
            "3. Pou Jisu @&4 chamdan loumei,",
            "Pu Raguang kai guangtang pukhou;",
            "Lajiunah nousuan pui ngai dai khoutei,",
            "Laujiunah him thuan ni halleluijah.",
            "",
            "4. Nthanmei guai ta duang lana,",
            "Tingkum ching khat guang tu cham ni;",
            "Neilamei munpuang tei tuai dat lak khe,",
            "Kangan maknga thuan ni halleluijah."
          ]
        }
      }
